<h2>What ticket customer service can help with</h2>
<h3>Orders and delivery</h3>
<p>Check your delivery status in your account dashboard or your confirmation email first. If tickets have not arrived when you expect them, contact us and we will look into the order.</p>
<h3>Refunds and event changes</h3>
<p>The Quick Help section above says refunds are processed within 5 to 10 business days and that event cancellations qualify for full refunds. For the detail on what is covered, read our <a href="/ticket-buyer-protection">ticket buyer protection</a> and <a href="/worry-free-guarantee">Worry Free Guarantee</a> pages.</p>
<h3>Selling tickets and account help</h3>
<p>If you want to resell tickets, open Sell Tickets in your account. For login, password or profile questions, start with our <a href="/ticket-faq">ticket FAQ</a>, then message us if you are still stuck.</p>

<h2>Before you contact ticket customer service</h2>
<ol>
<li>Find your order ID in the confirmation email.</li>
<li>Note the event name, date and the section you bought.</li>
<li>Pick the topic that fits: order inquiry, refund request, technical support, partnership or other.</li>
<li>Describe what you expected and what happened, in a few sentences.</li>
</ol>
<div class="so-callout"><p>Reporting a suspicious message or a possible scam? The U.S. government lists where to <a href="https://www.usa.gov/consumer-complaints" target="_blank" rel="noopener">file a consumer complaint</a>.</p></div>

